$(1)$ Find the analytical expression of the profit $W(x)$ in the year 2023 as a function of the annual output $x$ (in thousand units) (Profit = Revenue - Cost);

$(2)$ For what annual output $x$ (in thousand units) in 2023 will the company make the maximum profit? What is the maximum profit?

